<title>SWITZERLAND: Surveillance 1996 H1 profit up 10.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Surveillance 1996 H1 profit up 10.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			110.9	     vs 100</p>
<p> Group operating profit     136.08	    vs 111.09</p>
<p> Cash flow			171.7	     vs 152.5</p>
<p> Turnover			 1,401.7	   vs 1,291.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of Swiss inspection and testing group is Societe Generale de Surveillance Holding SA. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
